concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Act: • This Act sets up a system for regulating telecommunications. • The main entities regulated by this Act are carriers and service providers. • A carrier is the holder of a carrier licence granted under this Act." ;
    skos:definition "The following is a simplified outline of this Act: • This Act sets up a system for regulating telecommunications. • The main entities regulated by this Act are carriers and service providers. • A carrier is the holder of a carrier licence granted under this Act."@en ;
