concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 Extension to external Territories"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Act extends to:  (a) the Territory of Christmas Island; and  (b) the Territory of Cocos (Keeling) Islands; and  (c) such other external Territories (if any) as are prescribed.  (2) The operation of this Act in relation to Norfolk Island is not affected by the amendments made by Division 1 of Part 1 of Schedule 5 to the Territories Legislation Amendment Act 2016." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This Act extends to:  (a) the Territory of Christmas Island; and  (b) the Territory of Cocos (Keeling) Islands; and  (c) such other external Territories (if any) as are prescribed.  (2) The operation of this Act in relation to Norfolk Island is not affected by the amendments made by Division 1 of Part 1 of Schedule 5 to the Territories Legislation Amendment Act 2016."@en ;
