doc:sec-14-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "14(4) Controlled carriage services, controlled networks and controlled" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of this section, a telecommunications network, or a facility, satisfies the geographical test if:  (a) the whole or any part of the network or facility, as the case requires, is, or will be, located in Australia; or  (b) all of the following conditions are satisfied:  (i) a person, or a group of persons, operates the network or the facility, as the case requires;  (ii) the person, or at least one of the members of the group, carries on, or will carry on, a telecommunications-related business wholly or partly in Australia;  (iii) the network, or the facility, as the case requires, is used, or will be used, to supply a listed carriage service, or a service that is ancillary or incidental to such a service. Definition" ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-14-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14(5) Controlled carriage services, controlled networks and controlled"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-14-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) In this section: telecommunications-related business means a business that consists of, or includes:  (a) supplying a carriage service; or  (b) supplying goods or services for use in connection with the supply of a carriage service; or  (c) supplying a content service; or  (d) installing, maintaining, operating or providing access to:  (i) a telecommunications network; or  (ii) a facility." ;
    skos:definition "(5) In this section: telecommunications-related business means a business that consists of, or includes:  (a) supplying a carriage service; or  (b) supplying goods or services for use in connection with the supply of a carriage service; or  (c) supplying a content service; or  (d) installing, maintaining, operating or providing access to:  (i) a telecommunications network; or  (ii) a facility."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3b43c187b7b85b988c8d765db647b8c33315b390f56555433173d7be1bca94e4" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-14 ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines telecommunications-related business" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
