    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Act, the following carriage services are listed carriage services:  (a) a carriage service between a point in Australia and one or more other points in Australia;  (b) a carriage service between a point and one or more other points, where the first-mentioned point is in Australia and at least one of the other points is outside Australia;  (c) a carriage service between a point and one or more other points, where the first-mentioned point is outside Australia and at least one of the other points is in Australia."@en ;
