concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-26 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26 Single line links connecting distinct places in Australia"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) a line link connects distinct places in Australia; and  (b) the distinct places are at least the statutory distance apart; the line link is a network unit.  (2) For the purposes of this section, the statutory distance is:  (a) 500 metres; or  (b) if a longer distance, not exceeding 50 kilometres, is specified in the regulations—that longer distance." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) a line link connects distinct places in Australia; and  (b) the distinct places are at least the statutory distance apart; the line link is a network unit.  (2) For the purposes of this section, the statutory distance is:  (a) 500 metres; or  (b) if a longer distance, not exceeding 50 kilometres, is specified in the regulations—that longer distance."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7cfafade754699b7ab251c822504c45ae82336f087057fc7a4c3f0fbf003f000" ;
    cof:pageNumber "56"^^xsd:integer ;
