    cof:title "39 Principal user of a property" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The principal user of a property is the person who:  (a) occupies the property; or  (b) uses the property for the purpose that is the sole or principal purpose for which the property is used.  (2) However, if 2 or more persons:  (a) together occupy a property; or  (b) together use a property for the purpose that is the sole or principal purpose for which the property is used; they are taken to together be the principal user of the property." ;
    cof:pageNumber "68"^^xsd:integer .

