concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-41 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41 Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41 ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • The owner of a network unit that is used to supply carriage services to the public must hold a carrier licence unless:  (a) a nominated carrier declaration is in force in relation to the network unit; or  (b) an exemption applies. • Carrier licences are granted by the ACMA. • The holder of a carrier licence is known as a carrier. • If responsibility for a network unit is transferred from the owner of the unit to a carrier, the ACMA may make a nominated carrier declaration that declares the carrier to be the nominated carrier in relation to the unit. • Carrier licences are subject to conditions." ;
    skos:definition "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • The owner of a network unit that is used to supply carriage services to the public must hold a carrier licence unless:  (a) a nominated carrier declaration is in force in relation to the network unit; or  (b) an exemption applies. • Carrier licences are granted by the ACMA. • The holder of a carrier licence is known as a carrier. • If responsibility for a network unit is transferred from the owner of the unit to a carrier, the ACMA may make a nominated carrier declaration that declares the carrier to be the nominated carrier in relation to the unit. • Carrier licences are subject to conditions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "01576eef9526b5ecc4f7072874b04ee060a33fa9b2aadfba9eb6f084a3dbd1ba" ;
    cof:pageNumber "69"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Owner of network unit must hold carrier licence unless exemption applies or nominated carrier declaration is in force." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.69" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-41-norm .
concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-41-norm a values:Obligation ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-41 ;
