concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-42-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42(5) Network unit not to be used without carrier licence or nominated"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-42-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A person who contravenes subsection (1), (2), (3) or (4) commits an offence punishable on conviction by a fine not exceeding 20,000 penalty units. Note: See also sections 4AA and 4B of the Crimes Act 1914." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A person who contravenes subsection (1), (2), (3) or (4) commits an offence punishable on conviction by a fine not exceeding 20,000 penalty units. Note: See also sections 4AA and 4B of the Crimes Act 1914."@en ;
