concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-44-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44(2) Supply to the public"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If:  (a) there is only one owner of a network unit; and  (b) no nominated carrier declaration is in force in relation to the unit; and  (c) any of the following conditions is satisfied:  (i) the unit is used for the carriage of communications between 2 end-users, where each end-user is outside the immediate circle of the owner of the unit;  (ii) the unit is used to supply point-to-multipoint services to end-users, where at least one end-user is outside the immediate circle of the owner of the unit;  (iii) the unit is used to supply designated content services (other than point-to-multipoint services) to one or more end-users, where at least one end-user is outside the immediate circle of the owner of the unit; the unit is used to supply a carriage service to the public." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If:  (a) there is only one owner of a network unit; and  (b) no nominated carrier declaration is in force in relation to the unit; and  (c) any of the following conditions is satisfied:  (i) the unit is used for the carriage of communications between 2 end-users, where each end-user is outside the immediate circle of the owner of the unit;  (ii) the unit is used to supply point-to-multipoint services to end-users, where at least one end-user is outside the immediate circle of the owner of the unit;  (iii) the unit is used to supply designated content services (other than point-to-multipoint services) to one or more end-users, where at least one end-user is outside the immediate circle of the owner of the unit; the unit is used to supply a carriage service to the public."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c3c65a9b094177053f9226cff39020553a1e44dc27f4f4c6a7c7ef625caee396" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-44 ;
    cof:pageNumber "71"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Supply to the public" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
