concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-44-ss-2 cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-44-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4 .
concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-44-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4 a cml:LogicApplication ;
    cml:modality cml:Diffusion ;
