concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-51 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "51 Exemption—Ministerial determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-51 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that section 42 does not apply in relation to:  (a) a specified network unit; or  (b) a specified person; or  (c) a specified use of a network unit.   Carriers  Part 3 Prohibitions relating to carriers  Division 2  Section 51  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) A determination under this section may be unconditional or subject to such conditions (if any) as are specified in the determination.  (3) A determination under this section has effect accordingly." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that section 42 does not apply in relation to:  (a) a specified network unit; or  (b) a specified person; or  (c) a specified use of a network unit.   Carriers  Part 3 Prohibitions relating to carriers  Division 2  Section 51  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) A determination under this section may be unconditional or subject to such conditions (if any) as are specified in the determination.  (3) A determination under this section has effect accordingly."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "04cc8a1a4598fc55c8b652d933214040ee97a4c090acf3e7526876c1ab1a82d9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-51-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-51-ss-2 ;
