concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-53a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53A Copy of application to be given to Communications Access"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-53a ;
    values:originalText "Coordinator  (1) The ACMA must give a copy of the application to a Communications Access Coordinator.  (2) For the purposes of sections 56A and 59, the application is taken not to have been received by the ACMA until the copy is received by a Communications Access Coordinator." ;
    skos:definition "Coordinator  (1) The ACMA must give a copy of the application to a Communications Access Coordinator.  (2) For the purposes of sections 56A and 59, the application is taken not to have been received by the ACMA until the copy is received by a Communications Access Coordinator."@en ;
