    skos:prefLabel "54 Application to be accompanied by charge"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-54 ;
    values:originalText "An application must be accompanied by the charge (if any) imposed on the application by Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Carrier Licence Charges) Act 1997.   Carriers  Part 3 Carrier licences  Division 3  Section 55  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
