concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-56aa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56AA Deemed carrier licence—designated Telstra successor"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-56aa ;
    values:originalText "company Scope  (1) This section applies to a body corporate if:  (a) either of the following conditions are satisfied in relation to a particular time (the relevant time):  (i) the relevant time occurs immediately after the commencement of this section, and the body corporate is a designated Telstra successor company at the relevant time;" ;
    skos:definition "company Scope  (1) This section applies to a body corporate if:  (a) either of the following conditions are satisfied in relation to a particular time (the relevant time):  (i) the relevant time occurs immediately after the commencement of this section, and the body corporate is a designated Telstra successor company at the relevant time;"@en ;
