doc:sec-59-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "59(1) Time limit on licence decision" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the ACMA neither grants, nor refuses to grant, a carrier licence before the end of the deadline day worked out under the following subsections, then the ACMA is taken, at the end of that day, to have refused to grant the licence. Case 1: no section 55 request and no section 56A notice in force" ;
