    skos:prefLabel "59(2) Time limit on licence decision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-59-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If:  (a) the ACMA did not give a section 55 request; and  (b) there is no section 56A notice in force at the end of the 20th business day after the application day; then the deadline day is the 20th business day after the application day. Case 2: no section 55 request but section 56A notice in force" ;
