concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-62e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "62E Condition of carrier licence set out in section 37 of the National"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-62e ;
    values:originalText "Broadband Network Companies Act 2011  A carrier licence held by an NBN corporation is subject to the condition set out in section 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011. Note: Section 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011 deals with rules about: (a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and (b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and (c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and (d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations." ;
    skos:definition "Broadband Network Companies Act 2011  A carrier licence held by an NBN corporation is subject to the condition set out in section 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011. Note: Section 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011 deals with rules about: (a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and (b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and (c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and (d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0138b13123fb154d3e9e8da2e1705b7098511f428d194b8ce0c5d9a8a971681c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "96"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Condition of carrier licence set out in section 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.96" ;
