doc:sec-63-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "63(1) Conditions of carrier licence declared by Minister" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that each carrier licence is subject to such conditions as are specified in the instrument.   Carriers  Part 3 Carrier licences  Division 3  Section 63  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Conditions applying to specified existing carrier licences" ;
    cof:pageNumber "96"^^xsd:integer .

