    skos:prefLabel "63(2) Conditions of carrier licence declared by Minister"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-63-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that a specified carrier licence is subject to such conditions as are specified in the instrument. Note: A licence may be specified by name, by inclusion in a specified class or in any other way. Conditions applying to specified future carrier licences" ;
