concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-65 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "65 Conditions about foreign ownership or control"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-65 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A condition of a carrier licence may relate to the extent of foreign ownership or control (whether direct or indirect) of the holder.  (2) Subsection (1) does not, by implication, limit the conditions that may be declared under section 63." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A condition of a carrier licence may relate to the extent of foreign ownership or control (whether direct or indirect) of the holder.  (2) Subsection (1) does not, by implication, limit the conditions that may be declared under section 63."@en ;
