concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-68 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "68 Compliance with conditions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-68 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A carrier must not contravene a condition of the carrier licence held by the carrier.  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1).  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A carrier must not contravene a condition of the carrier licence held by the carrier.  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1).  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "43ba6bffb62951efdb83e24e7e7f501a3e89fa8ba06ada1412baf310d48d4eaf" ;
    cof:pageNumber "102"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-68-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-68-ss-2 ;
