concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-68-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "68(2) Compliance with conditions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-68-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1)." ;
