doc:sec-69aa-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "69AA(3) Remedial directions—breach of conditions relating to access" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The following are examples of the kinds of direction that may be given to a carrier under subsection (2):  (a) a direction that the carrier implement effective administrative systems for monitoring compliance with the condition;  (b) a direction that the carrier implement a system designed to give the carrier’s employees, agents and contractors a reasonable knowledge and understanding of the requirements of the condition, in so far as those requirements affect the employees, agents or contractors concerned." ;
    cof:pageNumber "105"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-69aa-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "69AA(4) Remedial directions—breach of conditions relating to access"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-69aa-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The ACCC must not give a direction under subsection (2) if the direction would have the effect of:  (aa) preventing a designated Telstra successor company from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577A; or  (a) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577C or 577E; or" ;
    skos:definition "(4) The ACCC must not give a direction under subsection (2) if the direction would have the effect of:  (aa) preventing a designated Telstra successor company from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577A; or  (a) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577C or 577E; or"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fab26bda2ab9854a9a18cc13f52d969254652f9b1438e63cae5c1d97bf136146" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-69aa ;
    cof:pageNumber "105"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Preventing ACCC from giving a direction that would prevent Telstra from complying with an undertaking." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
