concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-70-ss-4e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70(4E) Formal warnings—breach of condition"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-70-ss-4e ;
    values:originalText "(4E) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011. Note: Section 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011 deals with rules about: (a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and (b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and (c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and (d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations." ;
    skos:definition "(4E) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011. Note: Section 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011 deals with rules about: (a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and (b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and (c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and (d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations."@en ;
