    skos:definition "(1) The ACMA may cancel a carrier licence held by a carrier if the carrier fails to pay in full any annual charge on or before the date   Carriers  Part 3 Carrier licences  Division 3  Section 72  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  on which the charge becomes due and payable. For this purpose, annual charge means charge imposed by Part 3 of the Telecommunications (Carrier Licence Charges) Act 1997. Failure to pay industry levy"@en ;
