concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-73-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73(4) Collection of charges relating to carrier licences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-73-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The ACMA may, by written instrument, determine that, if any annual charge payable by a person remains unpaid after the time when it became due for payment, the person is liable to pay to the Commonwealth, by way of penalty, an amount calculated at the rate of:  (a) 20% per annum; or  (b) if the determination specifies a lower percentage—that lower percentage per annum; on the amount unpaid, computed from that time. Determination has effect" ;
    skos:definition "(4) The ACMA may, by written instrument, determine that, if any annual charge payable by a person remains unpaid after the time when it became due for payment, the person is liable to pay to the Commonwealth, by way of penalty, an amount calculated at the rate of:  (a) 20% per annum; or  (b) if the determination specifies a lower percentage—that lower percentage per annum; on the amount unpaid, computed from that time. Determination has effect"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e524380f783f8d2bbff42b4d3dc78eae2b749b2eb4da964c90bb09701c8ad45a" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-73 ;
    cof:pageNumber "110"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Penalty for unpaid annual charge" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.110" ;
