concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-75 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "75 Cancellation of certain exemptions from charge"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-75 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section cancels the effect of a provision of another Act that would have the effect of exempting a person from liability to pay charge imposed by the Telecommunications (Carrier Licence Charges) Act 1997.  (2) The cancellation does not apply if the provision of the other Act is enacted after the commencement of this section and refers specifically to charge imposed by the Telecommunications (Carrier Licence Charges) Act 1997." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section cancels the effect of a provision of another Act that would have the effect of exempting a person from liability to pay charge imposed by the Telecommunications (Carrier Licence Charges) Act 1997.  (2) The cancellation does not apply if the provision of the other Act is enacted after the commencement of this section and refers specifically to charge imposed by the Telecommunications (Carrier Licence Charges) Act 1997."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "74f4a30c455b499da5a2cf4badf64853acc3e6098b68fb2515b281913fe1b494" ;
    cof:pageNumber "113"^^xsd:integer ;
