concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-76 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "76 Commonwealth not liable to charge"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-76 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commonwealth is not liable to pay charge imposed by the Telecommunications (Carrier Licence Charges) Act 1997.  (2) A reference in this section to the Commonwealth includes a reference to an authority of the Commonwealth that cannot, by law of the Commonwealth, be made liable to taxation by the Commonwealth." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commonwealth is not liable to pay charge imposed by the Telecommunications (Carrier Licence Charges) Act 1997.  (2) A reference in this section to the Commonwealth includes a reference to an authority of the Commonwealth that cannot, by law of the Commonwealth, be made liable to taxation by the Commonwealth."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9e5701e53be0c2b36da196f27764e6846d4e872a44c76fdab289867c95d01c6f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "113"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-76-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-76-ss-2 ;
