concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-81a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "81A Obligations of nominated carrier"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-81a ;
    values:originalText "(1) If at any time the nominated carrier does not own or operate the network units, this Act nevertheless applies to the nominated carrier in relation to the network units as if they were owned or operated by the nominated carrier.  (2) Subsection (1) does not affect the application of this Act in relation to any other person who owns or operates the network units." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If at any time the nominated carrier does not own or operate the network units, this Act nevertheless applies to the nominated carrier in relation to the network units as if they were owned or operated by the nominated carrier.  (2) Subsection (1) does not affect the application of this Act in relation to any other person who owns or operates the network units."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "68d22ce97817c2a7dbaf6529aabdf8753cbd121668a390b93440e8e49b7ad46f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "115"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-81a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-81a-ss-2 ;
