    values:originalText "(5) If a person requests that a copy be provided in an electronic form, the ACMA may provide the relevant information:  (a) on a data processing device; or  (b) by way of electronic transmission.   Service providers  Part 4 Simplified outline  Division 1  Section 85  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
