concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-85 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "85 Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-85 ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • A service provider is:  (a) a carriage service provider; or  (b) a content service provider. • A carriage service provider is a person who supplies, or proposes to supply, certain carriage services. • A content service provider is a person who supplies, or proposes to supply, certain content services. • Service providers must comply with the service provider rules." ;
    skos:definition "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • A service provider is:  (a) a carriage service provider; or  (b) a content service provider. • A carriage service provider is a person who supplies, or proposes to supply, certain carriage services. • A content service provider is a person who supplies, or proposes to supply, certain content services. • Service providers must comply with the service provider rules."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4f145e49c1685ce157d74ed61c1644bbc92c360e470e2b1bfdfab1f352c34f3c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "119"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Service providers must comply with service provider rules." ;
