concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-87 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "87 Carriage service providers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-87 ;
    values:originalText "Basic definition  (1) For the purposes of this Act, if a person supplies, or proposes to supply, a listed carriage service to the public using:  (a) a network unit owned by one or more carriers; or  (b) a network unit in relation to which a nominated carrier declaration is in force; the person is a carriage service provider. International carriage service providers  (2) For the purposes of this Act, if:  (a) a person supplies, or proposes to supply, a listed carriage service to the public using:  (i) a line link connecting a place in Australia and a place outside Australia; or  (ii) a satellite-based facility; and  (b) the carriage service is mentioned in paragraph 16(1)(b) or (c); the person is a carriage service provider. Secondary users of exempt network units  (3) For the purposes of this Act, if:  (a) a carrier or an exempt network-user supplies a carriage service as mentioned in any of the following provisions:  (i) paragraph 45(2)(b);  (ii) paragraph 47(5)(b);  (iv) paragraph 47(7)(b);  (v) paragraph 47(8)(b);  (vi) paragraph 48(2)(d);  (vii) paragraph 48(4)(b);" ;
    skos:definition "Basic definition  (1) For the purposes of this Act, if a person supplies, or proposes to supply, a listed carriage service to the public using:  (a) a network unit owned by one or more carriers; or  (b) a network unit in relation to which a nominated carrier declaration is in force; the person is a carriage service provider. International carriage service providers  (2) For the purposes of this Act, if:  (a) a person supplies, or proposes to supply, a listed carriage service to the public using:  (i) a line link connecting a place in Australia and a place outside Australia; or  (ii) a satellite-based facility; and  (b) the carriage service is mentioned in paragraph 16(1)(b) or (c); the person is a carriage service provider. Secondary users of exempt network units  (3) For the purposes of this Act, if:  (a) a carrier or an exempt network-user supplies a carriage service as mentioned in any of the following provisions:  (i) paragraph 45(2)(b);  (ii) paragraph 47(5)(b);  (iv) paragraph 47(7)(b);  (v) paragraph 47(8)(b);  (vi) paragraph 48(2)(d);  (vii) paragraph 48(4)(b);"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "09349dbdd578f137bde0f2ac3b75d215cbe844f857e4ff020229b5401e392943" ;
    cof:pageNumber "121"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-87-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-87-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-87-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
