    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of this Act, if:  (a) a carrier or an exempt network-user supplies a carriage service as mentioned in any of the following provisions:  (i) paragraph 45(2)(b);  (ii) paragraph 47(5)(b);  (iv) paragraph 47(7)(b);  (v) paragraph 47(8)(b);  (vi) paragraph 48(2)(d);  (vii) paragraph 48(4)(b);" ;
    cof:pageNumber "121"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-88 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "88 Supply to the public"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-88 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section sets out the circumstances in which a carriage service is taken, for the purposes of subsections 87(1), (2) and (3), to be supplied to the public.  (2) If:  (a) a carriage service is used for the carriage of communications between 2 end-users; and  (b) each end-user is outside the immediate circle of the supplier of the service; the service is supplied to the public.  (3) If:  (a) a carriage service is used to supply point-to-multipoint services to end-users; and  (b) at least one end-user is outside the immediate circle of the supplier of the service; the service is supplied to the public.  (4) If:  (a) a carriage service is used to supply designated content services (other than point-to-multipoint services) to end-users; and" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section sets out the circumstances in which a carriage service is taken, for the purposes of subsections 87(1), (2) and (3), to be supplied to the public.  (2) If:  (a) a carriage service is used for the carriage of communications between 2 end-users; and  (b) each end-user is outside the immediate circle of the supplier of the service; the service is supplied to the public.  (3) If:  (a) a carriage service is used to supply point-to-multipoint services to end-users; and  (b) at least one end-user is outside the immediate circle of the supplier of the service; the service is supplied to the public.  (4) If:  (a) a carriage service is used to supply designated content services (other than point-to-multipoint services) to end-users; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "57dcfc506f26881a7d5e97021f4e8cf7186d74726133fe2b004586758701a3a8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "123"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-88-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-88-ss-2 ;
