    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a specified regulatory provision does not apply to a specified person in the person’s capacity as a designated carriage service provider. For this purpose, a designated carriage service provider is a person who is a carriage service provider under subsection 87(4) or (5). Note: For specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act 2003."@en ;
