concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-101 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "101 Service providers must comply with service provider rules"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-101 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A service provider must comply with the service provider rules that apply to the provider. Note: Service provider rules is defined by section 98.   Service providers  Part 4 Service provider rules  Division 5  Section 102  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1).  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A service provider must comply with the service provider rules that apply to the provider. Note: Service provider rules is defined by section 98.   Service providers  Part 4 Service provider rules  Division 5  Section 102  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1).  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9444f25189f489ff9485e12559252809e11b01f5e9eff1c6b4f50bfb8256615d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "132"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-101-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-101-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-101-ss-3 ;
