doc:sec-108a-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "108A(2) Electronic messaging service provider" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), a service is supplied to the public if, and only if, at least one end-user of the service is outside the immediate circle of the supplier of the service." ;
    cof:pageNumber "141"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-108a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "108A(3) Electronic messaging service provider"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-108a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In this section: electronic message has the same meaning as in the Spam Act 2003. electronic messaging service means a service that enables any or all of the following electronic messages to be sent or received:  (a) web-based email;  (b) instant messages;  (c) text messages;  (d) messages of a kind specified in the regulations. message has the same meaning as in the Spam Act 2003." ;
    skos:definition "(3) In this section: electronic message has the same meaning as in the Spam Act 2003. electronic messaging service means a service that enables any or all of the following electronic messages to be sent or received:  (a) web-based email;  (b) instant messages;  (c) text messages;  (d) messages of a kind specified in the regulations. message has the same meaning as in the Spam Act 2003."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c161cb9f924c4c257f3622980c95e18baff80a38414ef3bc87ce7f5bb8543e52" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-108a ;
    cof:pageNumber "141"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Definition of electronic messaging service provider" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
