concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-114 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "114 Industry codes and industry standards may confer powers on"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-114 ;
    values:originalText "the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman  (1) If the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman consents, an industry code or industry standard may confer functions and powers on the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman.  (2) The continuity of a consent under subsection (1) is not affected by:  (a) a change in the occupancy of the position of Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman; or  (b) a vacancy in the position of Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman that does not continue for more than 4 months." ;
    skos:definition "the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman  (1) If the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman consents, an industry code or industry standard may confer functions and powers on the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman.  (2) The continuity of a consent under subsection (1) is not affected by:  (a) a change in the occupancy of the position of Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman; or  (b) a vacancy in the position of Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman that does not continue for more than 4 months."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "205f9ce45bbf457d0936d9c0aefc2bada3efaaae8da393227551b1f724e3855b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "156"^^xsd:integer ;
