r  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (2).  (4) Subsections (2) and (3) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions.  (5) A direction under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument." ;
