concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-121-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "121(3) Directions about compliance with industry codes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-121-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (2); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (2); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (2); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (2)." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (2); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (2); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (2); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (2)."@en ;
