concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-125aa-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "125AA(4) ACMA must determine an industry standard if directed by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-125aa-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Minister may, in writing, direct the ACMA to:  (a) determine a standard under subsection (1) that:   Industry codes and industry standards  Part 6 Industry standards  Division 5  Section 125A  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (i) applies to participants in a specified section of the telecommunications industry; and  (ii) deals with one or more specified matters relating to the telecommunications activities of those participants; and  (b) do so within a specified period." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The Minister may, in writing, direct the ACMA to:  (a) determine a standard under subsection (1) that:   Industry codes and industry standards  Part 6 Industry standards  Division 5  Section 125A  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (i) applies to participants in a specified section of the telecommunications industry; and  (ii) deals with one or more specified matters relating to the telecommunications activities of those participants; and  (b) do so within a specified period."@en ;
