concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-129 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "129 Formal warnings—breach of industry standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-129 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies to a person who is a participant in a particular section of the telecommunications industry, the telemarketing industry or the fax marketing industry.  (2) The ACMA may issue a formal warning if the person contravenes an industry standard registered under this Part." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies to a person who is a participant in a particular section of the telecommunications industry, the telemarketing industry or the fax marketing industry.  (2) The ACMA may issue a formal warning if the person contravenes an industry standard registered under this Part."@en ;
