concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-132 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "132 Public consultation on industry standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-132 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Before determining or varying an industry standard, the ACMA must:  (a) cause to be published in a newspaper circulating in each State a notice:  (i) stating that the ACMA has prepared a draft of the industry standard or variation; and  (ii) stating that free copies of the draft will be made available to members of the public during normal office hours throughout the period specified in the notice; and  (iii) specifying the place or places where the copies will be available; and  (iv) inviting interested persons to give written comments about the draft to the ACMA within the period specified under subparagraph (ii); and  (b) make copies of the draft available in accordance with the notice." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Before determining or varying an industry standard, the ACMA must:  (a) cause to be published in a newspaper circulating in each State a notice:  (i) stating that the ACMA has prepared a draft of the industry standard or variation; and  (ii) stating that free copies of the draft will be made available to members of the public during normal office hours throughout the period specified in the notice; and  (iii) specifying the place or places where the copies will be available; and  (iv) inviting interested persons to give written comments about the draft to the ACMA within the period specified under subparagraph (ii); and  (b) make copies of the draft available in accordance with the notice."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "554c23942a13b856f1a8eeae16fa4fa26c511be1a8e074fee2aaa10e9c8e6a8e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "181"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Public consultation on industry standards before determining or varying an industry standard." ;
    dc:description "Notice and draft of the industry standard or variation, written comments to ACMA." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.181" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-132-norm .
