concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-133 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "133 Consultation with ACCC and the Telecommunications Industry"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-133 ;
    values:originalText "Ombudsman  (1) Before determining or varying an industry standard, the ACMA must consult the ACCC.  (1A) Before determining or varying an industry standard (other than an industry standard under section 125A or 125B), the ACMA must consult the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman.  (2) Before revoking an industry standard under subsection 131(1), the ACMA must consult the ACCC and the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman." ;
    skos:definition "Ombudsman  (1) Before determining or varying an industry standard, the ACMA must consult the ACCC.  (1A) Before determining or varying an industry standard (other than an industry standard under section 125A or 125B), the ACMA must consult the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman.  (2) Before revoking an industry standard under subsection 131(1), the ACMA must consult the ACCC and the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "608acc6d85b0a052b6969ca103904b47733a0641293cf9570a657c669f4da16d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "182"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-133-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-133-ss-1a ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-133-ss-2 ;
