concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-134 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "134 Consultation with Information Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-134 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies to an industry standard that deals with a matter set out in paragraph 113(3)(f), including a matter dealt with by:  (a) the Australian Privacy Principles; or  (b) other provisions of the Privacy Act 1988 relating to those principles; or  (c) a registered APP code (as defined in that Act); or  (d) provisions of that Act that relate to a registered APP code.   Industry codes and industry standards  Part 6 Industry standards  Division 5  Section 135  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) Before determining or varying the industry standard, the ACMA must consult the Information Commissioner.  (3) Before revoking the industry standard under subsection 131(1), the ACMA must consult the Information Commissioner." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies to an industry standard that deals with a matter set out in paragraph 113(3)(f), including a matter dealt with by:  (a) the Australian Privacy Principles; or  (b) other provisions of the Privacy Act 1988 relating to those principles; or  (c) a registered APP code (as defined in that Act); or  (d) provisions of that Act that relate to a registered APP code.   Industry codes and industry standards  Part 6 Industry standards  Division 5  Section 135  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) Before determining or varying the industry standard, the ACMA must consult the Information Commissioner.  (3) Before revoking the industry standard under subsection 131(1), the ACMA must consult the Information Commissioner."@en ;
