concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-142b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "142B Functional separation undertaking given by a person"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-142b ;
    values:originalText "A reference in this Part to a functional separation undertaking given by a person is a reference to a functional separation undertaking given by the person either:  (a) alone; or  (b) jointly with one or more other persons." ;
    skos:definition "A reference in this Part to a functional separation undertaking given by a person is a reference to a functional separation undertaking given by the person either:  (a) alone; or  (b) jointly with one or more other persons."@en ;
