concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-142ba a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "142BA Promotion of the long-term interests of end-users of carriage"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-142ba ;
    values:originalText "services and of services supplied by means of carriage services  For the purposes of this Part, the question whether a particular thing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of carriage services is to be determined in the same manner as it is determined for the purposes of Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010.   Local access lines  Part 8 Introduction  Division 1  Section 142BB  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "services and of services supplied by means of carriage services  For the purposes of this Part, the question whether a particular thing promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of carriage services is to be determined in the same manner as it is determined for the purposes of Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010.   Local access lines  Part 8 Introduction  Division 1  Section 142BB  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a79517257d4df57080a700ebffa0300d40f1002464548a3db03222505db59710" ;
