concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-143c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "143C Judicial enforcement of conditions and limitations of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-143c ;
    values:originalText "exemption determinations  (1) If the Federal Court is satisfied that a person has, on or after the designated commencement date, contravened any of the conditions   Local access lines  Part 8 Exemptions  Division 2A  Section 143D  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  or limitations of a determination under subsection 143A(1) or (2), the Court may, on the application of:  (a) the ACCC; or  (b) a carrier; or  (c) a carriage service provider; make all or any of the following orders:  (d) an order directing the person to comply with the condition or limitation;  (e) an order directing the person to compensate any other person (who may be the applicant) who has suffered loss or damage as a result of the contravention;  (f) any other order that the Court thinks appropriate.  (2) The Federal Court may discharge or vary an order granted under this section." ;
    skos:definition "exemption determinations  (1) If the Federal Court is satisfied that a person has, on or after the designated commencement date, contravened any of the conditions   Local access lines  Part 8 Exemptions  Division 2A  Section 143D  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  or limitations of a determination under subsection 143A(1) or (2), the Court may, on the application of:  (a) the ACCC; or  (b) a carrier; or  (c) a carriage service provider; make all or any of the following orders:  (d) an order directing the person to comply with the condition or limitation;  (e) an order directing the person to compensate any other person (who may be the applicant) who has suffered loss or damage as a result of the contravention;  (f) any other order that the Court thinks appropriate.  (2) The Federal Court may discharge or vary an order granted under this section."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dc72f9d5526f3a8ec1d86b61f59fd4440abd4f7d904f2c13cf50c718fb7c76ae" ;
    cof:pageNumber "210"^^xsd:integer ;
