    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-143g ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) the Telecommunications (Network Exemption—TransACT Very Small Scale Networks) Instrument 2012 was in force at the start of the designated commencement date; and  (b) a line came into existence on or after the designated commencement date; and  (c) the line forms part of the infrastructure of:" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) the Telecommunications (Network Exemption—TransACT Very Small Scale Networks) Instrument 2012 was in force at the start of the designated commencement date; and  (b) a line came into existence on or after the designated commencement date; and  (c) the line forms part of the infrastructure of:"@en ;
