concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-151d a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151D Further information about undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151d ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This section applies if:  (a) a person gives the ACCC a standard functional separation undertaking; or  (b) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a joint functional separation undertaking. Request for further information  (2) The ACCC may request the person or persons to give the ACCC further information about the undertaking.  (3) The ACCC may refuse to consider the undertaking until the person or persons give the ACCC the information.  (4) The ACCC may withdraw its request for further information, in whole or in part.   Local access lines  Part 8 Functional separation undertakings  Division 2B  Section 151E  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This section applies if:  (a) a person gives the ACCC a standard functional separation undertaking; or  (b) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a joint functional separation undertaking. Request for further information  (2) The ACCC may request the person or persons to give the ACCC further information about the undertaking.  (3) The ACCC may refuse to consider the undertaking until the person or persons give the ACCC the information.  (4) The ACCC may withdraw its request for further information, in whole or in part.   Local access lines  Part 8 Functional separation undertakings  Division 2B  Section 151E  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000" ;
    cof:pageNumber "236"^^xsd:integer ;
