    values:originalText "(2) If:   Local access lines  Part 8 Functional separation undertakings  Division 2B  Section 151J  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a joint functional separation undertaking (the first functional separation undertaking); and  (b) the ACCC rejects the first functional separation undertaking; and  (c) those persons subsequently give the ACCC another joint functional separation undertaking; and  (d) the ACCC is satisfied that any or all of the provisions of the first functional separation undertaking are materially similar to any or all of the provisions of the other functional separation undertaking; the ACCC may refuse to consider the other functional separation undertaking. Refund of fee" ;
    skos:definition "(2) If:   Local access lines  Part 8 Functional separation undertakings  Division 2B  Section 151J  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a joint functional separation undertaking (the first functional separation undertaking); and  (b) the ACCC rejects the first functional separation undertaking; and  (c) those persons subsequently give the ACCC another joint functional separation undertaking; and  (d) the ACCC is satisfied that any or all of the provisions of the first functional separation undertaking are materially similar to any or all of the provisions of the other functional separation undertaking; the ACCC may refuse to consider the other functional separation undertaking. Refund of fee"@en ;
