    cml:conclusionText "The ACCC will consider the varied undertaking under section 151F as if the varied undertaking had been given to the ACCC instead of the original undertaking." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sec-151k-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151K(2) Variation of functional separation undertaking that is under" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The ACCC may give the person or persons a written notice stating that, if:  (a) the person makes, or the persons make, such variations to the original undertaking as are specified in the notice; and  (b) the person gives, or the persons give, the varied undertaking to the ACCC within the period specified in the notice; the ACCC will consider the varied undertaking under section 151F as if the varied undertaking had been given to the ACCC instead of the original undertaking. Treatment of varied undertaking" ;
    cof:pageNumber "242"^^xsd:integer .

