    cof:title "151V(1) Criteria for accepting variation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if:  (a) a person gives the ACCC a variation of a standard functional separation undertaking; or  (b) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a variation of a joint functional separation undertaking. Criteria" ;
    cof:pageNumber "252"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-151v-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151V(2) Criteria for accepting variation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151v-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) In deciding whether to accept the variation, the ACCC must have regard to:  (a) whether the variation promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of carriage services; and  (b) the matters (if any) specified in a determination under subsection (3); and  (c) such other matters (if any) as the ACCC considers relevant." ;
    skos:definition "(2) In deciding whether to accept the variation, the ACCC must have regard to:  (a) whether the variation promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of carriage services; and  (b) the matters (if any) specified in a determination under subsection (3); and  (c) such other matters (if any) as the ACCC considers relevant."@en ;
