concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-151zc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZC Register of functional separation undertakings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151zc ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACCC is to maintain a Register in which the ACCC includes:  (a) all functional separation undertakings that have been accepted by the ACCC (including those that are no longer in force); and  (b) in the case of a functional separation undertaking that, under section 151B, is taken to have been given by a corporation:  (i) the name of the corporation; and  (ii) the date the undertaking came into force; and  (c) all variations of functional separation undertakings.  (2) The Register is to be maintained by electronic means.  (3) The Register is to be made available for inspection on the ACCC’s website.  (4) The Register is not a legislative instrument." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACCC is to maintain a Register in which the ACCC includes:  (a) all functional separation undertakings that have been accepted by the ACCC (including those that are no longer in force); and  (b) in the case of a functional separation undertaking that, under section 151B, is taken to have been given by a corporation:  (i) the name of the corporation; and  (ii) the date the undertaking came into force; and  (c) all variations of functional separation undertakings.  (2) The Register is to be maintained by electronic means.  (3) The Register is to be made available for inspection on the ACCC’s website.  (4) The Register is not a legislative instrument."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7ce6e8a99c252c95e4246e35bbb6dddab78113a282290b5ff5105632a239c605" ;
    cof:pageNumber "262"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-151zc-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-151zc-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-151zc-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-151zc-ss-4 ;
