doc:sec-151zl-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151ZL(5) Review by the Australian Competition Tribunal" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the ACCC makes a decision under section 151Z to vary a functional separation undertaking that was given by a person or persons, the person or persons may apply to the Australian Competition Tribunal for a review of the decision." ;
