concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-151zl-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZL(6) Review by the Australian Competition Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151zl-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) An application under this section for a review of a decision must be:  (a) in writing; and  (b) in the case of an application under subsection (1), (3), (4) or (5)—made within 21 days after the ACCC made the decision; and  (c) in the case of an application under subsection (2)—made within 14 days after the ACCC made the decision." ;
    skos:definition "(6) An application under this section for a review of a decision must be:  (a) in writing; and  (b) in the case of an application under subsection (1), (3), (4) or (5)—made within 21 days after the ACCC made the decision; and  (c) in the case of an application under subsection (2)—made within 14 days after the ACCC made the decision."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f8008bbef3d4e15eed38e5fae02497c04c28f1634baaefc53b1ffb474aaae791" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-151zl ;
    cof:pageNumber "275"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application for review of ACCC decision must be made within specified time frames." ;
