    skos:prefLabel "152 Associate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-152 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, an associate of a person (the controller) in relation to control of:  (a) a telecommunications network; or  (aa) a line; or  (b) a company; is:  (c) a partner of the controller; or" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Part, an associate of a person (the controller) in relation to control of:  (a) a telecommunications network; or  (aa) a line; or  (b) a company; is:  (c) a partner of the controller; or"@en ;
