doc:sec-154-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "154(1) Control of a company" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, the question of whether a person is in a position to exercise control of a company is to be determined under Schedule 1 to the Broadcasting Services Act 1992." ;
    cof:pageNumber "279"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-154-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154(2) Control of a company"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-154-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, in determining that question:  (a) the definition of associate in subsection 6(1) of the Broadcasting Services Act 1992 does not apply; and  (b) the definition of associate in section 152 of this Act applies instead. 155  When a person is in a position to exercise control of a network" ;
    skos:definition "(2) However, in determining that question:  (a) the definition of associate in subsection 6(1) of the Broadcasting Services Act 1992 does not apply; and  (b) the definition of associate in section 152 of this Act applies instead. 155  When a person is in a position to exercise control of a network"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "37730db5fdb60cdbb1545addc8dee1b487b077a6d9e65b8ebfc876b93d02bdb2" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-154 ;
