doc:sec-158a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "158A(1) Deemed local access lines" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:  (a) a local access line was in existence immediately before the designated commencement date; and  (b) the line is extended on or after the designated commencement date; then:  (c) the extension is taken to be a local access line in its own right; and  (d) the local access line referred to in paragraph (c) is taken to have come into existence on or after the designated commencement date." ;
