concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-161 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "161 Extended meaning of residential customer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-161 ;
    values:originalText "Home-based business carried on by an individual  (1) For the purposes of this Part, if a business is carried on (otherwise than in the capacity of trustee) by an individual, and:  (a) most or all of the work of the business is carried out at the residence of the individual; or  (b) the business does not occupy any premises other than the residence of the individual; the individual, in the individual’s capacity as a customer, is taken to be a residential customer. Home-based business carried on by a partnership  (2) For the purposes of this Part, if a business is carried on by a partnership, and:" ;
    skos:definition "Home-based business carried on by an individual  (1) For the purposes of this Part, if a business is carried on (otherwise than in the capacity of trustee) by an individual, and:  (a) most or all of the work of the business is carried out at the residence of the individual; or  (b) the business does not occupy any premises other than the residence of the individual; the individual, in the individual’s capacity as a customer, is taken to be a residential customer. Home-based business carried on by a partnership  (2) For the purposes of this Part, if a business is carried on by a partnership, and:"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "daeccc544b90222b3f6736c3519220c1957feb0954e277392c23dca469d02eb3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "289"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-161-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-161-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.289" .
doc:sec-161 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "161 Extended meaning of residential customer" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Home-based business carried on by an individual  (1) For the purposes of this Part, if a business is carried on (otherwise than in the capacity of trustee) by an individual, and:  (a) most or all of the work of the business is carried out at the residence of the individual; or  (b) the business does not occupy any premises other than the residence of the individual; the individual, in the individual’s capacity as a customer, is taken to be a residential customer. Home-based business carried on by a partnership  (2) For the purposes of this Part, if a business is carried on by a partnership, and:" ;
    cof:pageNumber "289"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-161-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "161(1) Extended meaning of residential customer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-161-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if a business is carried on (otherwise than in the capacity of trustee) by an individual, and:  (a) most or all of the work of the business is carried out at the residence of the individual; or  (b) the business does not occupy any premises other than the residence of the individual; the individual, in the individual’s capacity as a customer, is taken to be a residential customer. Home-based business carried on by a partnership" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if a business is carried on (otherwise than in the capacity of trustee) by an individual, and:  (a) most or all of the work of the business is carried out at the residence of the individual; or  (b) the business does not occupy any premises other than the residence of the individual; the individual, in the individual’s capacity as a customer, is taken to be a residential customer. Home-based business carried on by a partnership"@en ;
