concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-272 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "272 Number-database operator and eligible number-database"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-272 ;
    values:originalText "person  (1) For the purposes of this Part, a number-database operator is a person in respect of which a determination is in force under subsection 472(1).  (2) For the purposes of this Part, an eligible number-database person is a person who is:  (a) a number-database operator; or  (b) an employee of a number-database operator; or  (c) a number-database contractor; or  (d) an employee of a number-database contractor." ;
    skos:definition "person  (1) For the purposes of this Part, a number-database operator is a person in respect of which a determination is in force under subsection 472(1).  (2) For the purposes of this Part, an eligible number-database person is a person who is:  (a) a number-database operator; or  (b) an employee of a number-database operator; or  (c) a number-database contractor; or  (d) an employee of a number-database contractor."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "38a81e87e79631e602bf5fbd307ce2fcd382b1670c585ea09032aac778a80531" ;
