concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-275a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "275A Location information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-275a ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, information about the location of:  (a) a mobile telephone handset; or  (b) any other mobile communications device; is taken to be information that relates to the affairs of the customer responsible for the handset or device.  (2) For the purposes of this Part, a document about the location of:  (a) a mobile telephone handset; or  (b) any other mobile communications device; is taken to be a document that relates to the affairs of the customer responsible for the handset or device.  (3) This section is enacted for the avoidance of doubt." ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Part, information about the location of:  (a) a mobile telephone handset; or  (b) any other mobile communications device; is taken to be information that relates to the affairs of the customer responsible for the handset or device.  (2) For the purposes of this Part, a document about the location of:  (a) a mobile telephone handset; or  (b) any other mobile communications device; is taken to be a document that relates to the affairs of the customer responsible for the handset or device.  (3) This section is enacted for the avoidance of doubt."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "343ac4c9ce1b7c054e1e9d242aecf6f3a9aaa8e0cd9f92ba217caedc26ffdf38" ;
    cof:pageNumber "294"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-275a-ss-1 ;
