doc:sec-284-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "284(1A) Assisting the ACMA, the eSafety Commissioner, the ACCC or" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure by a person of information or a document if:  (a) the disclosure is made to:  (i) the eSafety Commissioner; or  (ii) a member of the staff of the ACMA whose duties relate to the performance of the eSafety Commissioner’s functions; and  (b) the information or document may assist the eSafety Commissioner to carry out his or her functions or powers." ;
    cof:pageNumber "306"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-284-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "284(2) Assisting the ACMA, the eSafety Commissioner, the ACCC or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-284-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure by a person of information or a document if:  (a) the disclosure is made to, or to a member of the staff of, the ACCC; and  (b) the information or document may assist the ACCC to carry out its telecommunications functions and powers." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure by a person of information or a document if:  (a) the disclosure is made to, or to a member of the staff of, the ACCC; and  (b) the information or document may assist the ACCC to carry out its telecommunications functions and powers."@en ;
