concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-284-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "284(3) Assisting the ACMA, the eSafety Commissioner, the ACCC or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-284-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure by a person of information or a document if:  (a) the disclosure is made to the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman, or to an employee of the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman; and  (b) the information or document may assist the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman in the consideration of a complaint made to the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman.   Protection of communications  Part 13 Exceptions to primary disclosure/use offences  Division 3  Section 285  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure by a person of information or a document if:  (a) the disclosure is made to the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman, or to an employee of the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman; and  (b) the information or document may assist the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman in the consideration of a complaint made to the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman.   Protection of communications  Part 13 Exceptions to primary disclosure/use offences  Division 3  Section 285  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9ecff8c79d83b4267d51b18a4c2e8e399e7116bdd6d27fb5f582070ecab7aa50" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-284 ;
    cof:pageNumber "306"^^xsd:integer ;
