concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-293 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "293 Uses connected with exempt disclosures"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-293 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Section 276 does not prohibit a use of information or a document if:  (a) the use is made for the purposes of, or in connection with, a disclosure of the information or document by the person; and  (b) because of this Division, the disclosure is not prohibited by section 276.  (2) Section 277 does not prohibit a use of information or a document if:  (a) the use is made for the purposes of, or in connection with, a disclosure of the information or document by the person; and  (b) because of this Division, the disclosure is not prohibited by section 277.  (3) Section 278 does not prohibit a use of information or a document if:  (a) the use is made for the purposes of, or in connection with, a disclosure of the information or document by the person; and  (b) because of this Division, the disclosure is not prohibited by section 278." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Section 276 does not prohibit a use of information or a document if:  (a) the use is made for the purposes of, or in connection with, a disclosure of the information or document by the person; and  (b) because of this Division, the disclosure is not prohibited by section 276.  (2) Section 277 does not prohibit a use of information or a document if:  (a) the use is made for the purposes of, or in connection with, a disclosure of the information or document by the person; and  (b) because of this Division, the disclosure is not prohibited by section 277.  (3) Section 278 does not prohibit a use of information or a document if:  (a) the use is made for the purposes of, or in connection with, a disclosure of the information or document by the person; and  (b) because of this Division, the disclosure is not prohibited by section 278."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f42a14cc9246f40eb46b53a93b3301fd55fd9d371f7d47b98839e017820985cf" ;
    cof:pageNumber "318"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-293-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-293-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-293-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.318" .
