concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-294 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "294 Effect of this Subdivision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-294 ;
    values:originalText "Nothing in this Subdivision limits the generality of anything else in it or in Divisions 3 to 5 of Part 4-1 of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979. Subdivision B—Burden of proof" ;
    skos:definition "Nothing in this Subdivision limits the generality of anything else in it or in Divisions 3 to 5 of Part 4-1 of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979. Subdivision B—Burden of proof"@en ;
