concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-295p a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "295P Conditions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-295p ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, do either or both of the following:  (a) determine that all authorisations under the integrated public number database scheme are granted subject to specified conditions;  (b) determine that a specified kind of authorisation under that scheme is granted subject to specified conditions." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, do either or both of the following:  (a) determine that all authorisations under the integrated public number database scheme are granted subject to specified conditions;  (b) determine that a specified kind of authorisation under that scheme is granted subject to specified conditions."@en ;
