concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-295t a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "295T Formal warnings for breaching a condition"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-295t ;
    values:originalText "The ACMA may issue a formal warning if the ACMA is satisfied that a person has contravened, or is contravening, a condition of an authorisation in force under the integrated public number database scheme. Subdivision D—Report to Minister" ;
    skos:definition "The ACMA may issue a formal warning if the ACMA is satisfied that a person has contravened, or is contravening, a condition of an authorisation in force under the integrated public number database scheme. Subdivision D—Report to Minister"@en ;
