concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-297 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "297 Authorisation by or under law"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-297 ;
    values:originalText "If information or a document is disclosed to a person for a particular purpose as permitted by section 280 or this section, the person must not disclose or use the information or document unless the disclosure or use is required or authorised by or under law." ;
    skos:definition "If information or a document is disclosed to a person for a particular purpose as permitted by section 280 or this section, the person must not disclose or use the information or document unless the disclosure or use is required or authorised by or under law."@en ;
