concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-302a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "302A Location dependent carriage services"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-302a ;
    values:originalText "(1) If information or a document is disclosed to a person as permitted by section 291A or this subsection, a person must not disclose or use the information or document except for the purpose of, or in connection with, the supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a location dependent carriage service. Note: Section 291A deals with the disclosure or use of information or documents for the purposes of the supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a location dependent carriage service.  (2) In this section: location dependent carriage service means a carriage service that depends for its provision on the availability of information about the addresses of end users of the carriage service." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If information or a document is disclosed to a person as permitted by section 291A or this subsection, a person must not disclose or use the information or document except for the purpose of, or in connection with, the supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a location dependent carriage service. Note: Section 291A deals with the disclosure or use of information or documents for the purposes of the supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a location dependent carriage service.  (2) In this section: location dependent carriage service means a carriage service that depends for its provision on the availability of information about the addresses of end users of the carriage service."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3da68903b907f1eeb4e4b6c78c1067bac20bc38d8c0deb3c4a9c8317c7fb72f3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "335"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-302a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-302a-ss-2 ;
